Subject: [PATCH] Refactor FXIOS-15059 [Technical Debt] [Redux] Rename for
 misleading `activeScreens` State terminology (#32426)

* Rename AppScreenState -> ComponentState, ActiveScreensState -> ActiveComponentsState, AppScreen -> AppComponent, ScreenActionType -> ComponentActionType. Update related property names.

* Rename concept from "active" components to "presented" components for more clarity.

* Update all call sites for name changes.

* Update unit tests for new naming.
